{"id": "unknown-2026-08-19-030", "date": "2026-08-19", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Türkiye’s PV module manufacturing capacity tops 13.2 GW", "content": "<p>Turkey has 13.2 GW of operational solar module manufacturing capacity, exceeding the 9.7 GW combined capacity of Italy, Germany, Spain, France, and the Netherlands, according to new figures released by Sinovoltaics. The country's current cell manufacturing capacity is around 2.5 GW, while wafer capacity stands at approximately 1.2 GW.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/19/turkiyes-pv-module-manufacturing-capacity-tops-13-2-gw/\">Türkiye&#8217;s PV module manufacturing", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/19/turkiyes-pv-module-manufacturing-capacity-tops-13-2-gw/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-08-19-031", "date": "2026-08-19", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 34, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Low concentrator photovoltaic receiver for wireless laser power transmission", "content": "<p>Researchers in Span have developed a 3 × 3 low-concentrator photovoltaic (LCPV) receiver combining crossed compound parabolic concentrator (CCPC) optics with current-based cell grouping for wireless laser power transmission (WLPT) under non-uniform irradiance. The prototype achieved 16.3% power conversion efficiency.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/19/low-concentrator-photovoltaic-receiver-for-wireless-laser-power-transmission/\">Low concentrator photovoltaic recei", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/08/19/low-concentrator-photovoltaic-receiver-for-wireless-laser-power-transmission/", "type": "rss"}]}
